						"description": "Partially update a user's information.\n\n**Authentication:** Required (Bearer Token)\n\n**URL Parameters:**\n- id (required, integer): User ID\n\n**Optional Fields:**\nSend only the fields you want to update.\n\n**Response:** Returns updated user object with roles."
					},
					"response": []
