									"key": "id",
									"value": "7",
									"description": "User ID to delete"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Delete a user from the system.\n\n**Authentication:** Required (Bearer Token)\n\n**URL Parameters:**\n- id (required, integer): User ID\n\n**Response:** Success message confirming deletion.\n\n**Warning:** This action cannot be undone."
					},
					"response": []
